  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>CuCl</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math> dissolve in water &amp; give blue coloured solutions</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>CuCl</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>nH</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8594;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>Cu</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>aq</mi><mo>)</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>AgCl</mi></math> not soluble in water.<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>Cu</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>Cl</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math> is not soluble in water.<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>ZnCl</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math> is soluble but colourless.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>ZnCl</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>nH</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8594;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>Zn</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>(</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>aq</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>)</mo><mo>&#160;</mo></math>colourless</p>",
